        "4968": {
          "synopsis": "Rebuild BarGradients: gradient k (0-5) is 16 entries, 8 read from FadeCurrent\nthen the same 8 backwards. Each pass starts one byte earlier, so gradient k\nhas k zero (transparent) entries at each end and only the first 8-k colours:\nthe higher the number, the narrower the bar.",
          "comment": "Colours to mirror"
